{"articleNo":"2996","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2996&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-2학기 가계곤란 대학원생 현황조사","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.10.26","hit":"9878","attachments":[{"name":"가계곤란학비감면신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2996&attachNo=2520"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 2pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 2pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 2pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 2pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"53\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"514\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">가계곤란 대학원생 현황조사</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\"></span>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원 학비감면에 반영하고자 대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 및 컨설팅대학원에 재학중인 가계곤란 대학원생 현황을 아래와 같이 조사하오니 해당자께서는 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">-&nbsp; 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래&nbsp; -</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;1. 신청대상 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">: 대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 및 컨설팅대학원 재</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">학생으로<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 아래 조건에 충족되는 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 기초생활수급자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 차상위계층 및 의료급여수급자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 장애인(1급-3급)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 저소득가구대상자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2. 신청기간</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : 2011.10.26(수)-11.01(화)[09:00~18:00]</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;3. 신청장소</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : 대학원지원팀(본관 302호/ ☏478-7015)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;4. 신청서류</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 기초생활수급자 : 기초수급자증명서 1부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt\">차상위계층 및 의료급여수급자 : 관할행정기관장의 확인서류 1부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 장애인(1급-3급) : 장애인복지카드 및 장애인증명서 1부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 저소득가구대상자&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 건강보험료납부확인서 1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 건강보험료산출기준 내역서 1부(건강보험공단 직접 방문으로 발급 가능)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 주민등록등본 1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) 건강보험카드 사본 1부.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 공통서류 : 가계곤란학비감면신청서(서식) 1부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 신청서류는 1개월이내 발급한것이어야 함</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">5. 신청방법</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : 신청서류 지참 후 본인이 직접 방문</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">\n</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">6. 기타사항</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">가계곤란 대학원생 현황조사와 관련한 자세한 문의사항은 본교&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 대학원지원팀(☏478-7015)으로 문의하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -111.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 111.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2011. 10.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
